1. Code ported or embedded in this repository
---------------------------------------------
None. The Node resolver (internal/eco/node/resolve) was written from the public pseudocode in the Node.js
documentation (modules.html, esm.html, packages.html) and the TypeScript documentation; no source code from Node.js,
TypeScript, oxc-resolver or enhanced-resolve was copied. No code, schema or fixtures from GitNexus (PolyForm
Noncommercial 1.0.0), codegraph or graphify were copied; those tools are only run as comparison baselines.

When ported or embedded code is added, record it here: source, version, license, files in this repository.

